   "widgets_values": [
    "**Dial Maker \u2014 MiniMax H3**\n\n1. Write pairs, one per line: `A ||| B`. Keep A and B identical except for the quality you want to steer.\n2. Optional: `{subject}` expands over the subjects list, so subject details cancel out.\n3. Run: the report shows how well the pairs agree (cos > 0.6 is a clean direction) and how much generic wording shift was removed (debias). The dial is saved to `models/loras/dials/<name>.safetensors`.\n4. Preview with the strength slider, then use the dial anywhere."
